atisfies (S1) and (S2) as well, see\nFormal Deformation Theory, Lemma\n<REF_0005>.\nThis holds in particular in the situation of\nLemma <REF_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:98edf95db1f967c67d87276622c5d4e6cb3e6f293a913852f53e320d89c9189f", "unit_id": "tag:07WV:statement"}
